Fetch the Bluesky home timeline as a compact, numbered list of posts. Each post gets a stable ref like [b1], [b2] with the author and full text, and is marked if it has an image or quotes another post. Use the ref with bluesky_reply, bluesky_like, or bluesky_hydrate_post — you never need to copy a post URL. Authentication is handled for you. Call this first before replying to or liking anything.
